# DME101.030 — Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator — caseload
library "DME101.030 Coverage Cases".
covers "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage".

// One approve path + two deny paths, exercising the criteria gate.

// ============ Patient ============

fact "Pat Jones":
- name is "Pat Jones".
- birth date is "1970-03-15".
- defined by "Patient".

// ============ Clinical facts ============

// T3b derive-local: the fact names its backing concept via `defined by`; the local
// `{system, code}` is DERIVED from the concept (NOT authored here). An authored `code is`
// on a local-concept fact is now a §5 conflict error.
fact "Documented Tibial Nonunion":
- date is "2026-02-01".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Documented Fracture Nonunion".

fact "Skull Fracture Finding":
- date is "2026-02-01".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Fracture Of Skull Or Vertebrae".

// The request being authorized — a covered-device stimulator. Supplying it clears the coverage
// gate so each case reaches its clinical determination. (Pat Jones, born 1970, clears the age gate.)
fact "Covered Stimulator Ordered":
- date is "2026-02-01".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Covered Device".

// Adult age asserted via the LOCAL arm of the both-rep age concept (the birthDate posrep
// computation is the emit/$apply path; the CRE reads the local assertion). Pat Jones is 55+.
fact "Adult Age Confirmed":
- date is "2026-02-01".
- defined by "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage"."Adult Eighteen Or Older".

// ============ Cases ============

case "Tibial nonunion, no exclusions → medically necessary":
- description is `A long-bone (tibial) fracture nonunion is documented, with no
  skull/vertebrae or tumor involvement and no concurrent noninvasive
  stimulator. All four coverage criteria hold → medically necessary.`.
- subject is "Pat Jones".
- fact is "Covered Stimulator Ordered".
- fact is "Adult Age Confirmed".
- fact is "Documented Tibial Nonunion".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage" is "certify.Approve".

case "Skull fracture → not medically necessary (exclusion)":
- description is `A documented nonunion, but the fracture is of the skull — the
  skull/vertebrae exclusion fails the criteria → not medically necessary.`.
- subject is "Pat Jones".
- fact is "Covered Stimulator Ordered".
- fact is "Adult Age Confirmed".
- fact is "Documented Tibial Nonunion".
- fact is "Skull Fracture Finding".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage" is "not-certify.Deny".

case "No documented nonunion (fresh fracture) → not medically necessary":
- description is `No documented fracture nonunion (e.g. a fresh fracture or
  delayed union) → the nonunion criterion fails → not medically necessary.`.
- subject is "Pat Jones".
- fact is "Covered Stimulator Ordered".
- fact is "Adult Age Confirmed".
- result is "Ultrasonic Osteogenesis Stimulator Coverage" is "not-certify.Deny".
